# Periodic 3D SM mesh on 30x30x30 mm cube. Lattice nodes are placed without
# reference to the fibres — those come in at the converter stage via
# #@inclusionfile and are discretised on top of the matrix Voronoi.
#@output nodes.dat
#@domain 3
#@diam 4.e-3
#@maxiter 10000
#@ranint -2
#@perflag 3 1 1 1
#@ranflag 1
# Bounding-box corners widen the localiser so periodic neighbour lookup works.
#@vertex 1 coords 3 -0.012 -0.012 -0.012
#@vertex 2 coords 3  0.042  0.042  0.042
#@prism 1 box 6 0. 0. 0. 0.03 0.03 0.03 refine 1. edgerefine 0.5 surfacerefine 0.7 regionrefine 1.
